      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels way more intense than just anxiety though. it's like i can actually feel the resistance in the air, like a barrier being set up to prevent people from accessing the higher frequencies during the alignment. if the interference is actually a way to shield the transition from being too widespread, what kind of shielding should i be creating for myself so i don't get blocked when the 17th actually hits? i need to be able to maintain the connection no matter what they try to do.",
